<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">THE LIBRARY MIND OF JOHN NATHAN TABOR</p><h1>One mind.<br>One connected system.</h1><p class="intro">Your books. Your languages. Your work.<br>One front door to everything connected here.</p><div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="#main-database">Open Main Database →</a><a class="button" href="#books">Browse all public books</a><a class="button" href="#book-apps">Open Book Apps</a><a class="button" href="../one/library-mind/index.html">Library Mind</a><a class="button" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#plan">Continue the original book plan</a><a class="button" href="../one/inventions-101/index.html">101 Inventions &amp; Book 12</a></div><p class="motto">OUR WORD IS OUR BOND · ALWAYS PROTECT THE ONE.</p></section>
<section id="library"><p class="eyebrow">BOOKS · LANGUAGES · EVIDENCE</p><h2>The work, connected.</h2><p id="counts" role="status">Loading the published archive counts…</p><div class="grid">
<a class="card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#documents"><span>01 / READ</span><h3>Books & translations</h3><p>Read the published source books, translation drafts, chapters and current manuscript.</p></a>
<a class="card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#plan"><span>02 / WRITE</span><h3>The original 13-book plan</h3><p>THE TABOR SECRET SOCIETY. Original titles and treatments, with Book I’s six-chapter draft.</p></a>
<a class="card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#languages"><span>03 / LANGUAGE</span><h3>Universal Language Registry</h3><p>Search documented profiles. The 66,666 catalog target stays distinct from the current registry.</p></a>
<a class="card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#catalog"><span>04 / CONNECT</span><h3>The master catalog</h3><p>Search book concepts, project records and connected collections.</p></a>
<a class="card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#downloads"><span>05 / EVIDENCE</span><h3>Dossier & complete packages</h3><p>Full dossier, evidence files, writing batches, translation packages and language database.</p></a>
<a class="card" href="../one/library/index.html"><span>06 / YOUR FILES</span><h3>Private Master Library</h3><p>Import your own original files into the existing browser-local library.</p></a>
</div><div class="source-links"><h3>Original sources & writing standards</h3><a href="../one/library-mind/sources/language-history-source.txt">Language history</a><a href="../one/library-mind/sources/universal-mammal-source.txt">Universal Mammal click/tik source</a><a href="../one/library-mind/books/tss-series-bible-source.md">Original series bible</a><a href="../../EDITORIAL_STANDARD.md">Nathan’s writing standard</a><a href="../one/library-mind/EDITORIAL_AUDIT.md">Editorial audit</a><a href="../one/library-mind/LANGUAGE_COVERAGE.md">Language coverage</a><p>Source files preserve the author’s words. Source inclusion does not certify a linguistic or scientific claim.</p></div></section>

<section id="main-database" class="library-experience" aria-labelledby="main-db-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">NATHAN AI · TABOR ROOT · SOURCE FIRST</p><h2 id="main-db-heading">Main Database</h2><p>One doorway to the original records, the published archive, and the private library you choose to import. Originals, translations, analysis, and book apps remain separate records.</p></div>
  <div class="library-experience-grid">
    <a class="library-experience-card" href="../one/library/index.html"><span class="card-kicker">01 · PRIVATE SOURCE</span><h3>ONE Master Library 101–901</h3><p>Import your original master database on your own device. Search source IDs, shelves and records; export your own files.</p><strong>Open local database ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="library-experience-card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#catalog"><span class="card-kicker">02 · PUBLIC INDEX</span><h3>The connected catalog</h3><p>Explore the existing publicly released project and book-reference catalog without confusing an index entry with a finished book.</p><strong>Browse catalog ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="library-experience-card" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#documents"><span class="card-kicker">03 · PUBLIC READER</span><h3>Library Mind</h3><p>Browse available English works, chapters, draft translations, research, the 13-book plan and their existing status labels.</p><strong>Open reader ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="library-experience-card" href="../vault.html"><span class="card-kicker">04 · ORIGINAL BYTES</span><h3>Creator Vault</h3><p>Keep your source files and original media separate from catalog metadata. The existing browser-local Vault handles user-selected originals.</p><strong>Open Vault ↗</strong></a>
  </div>
  <p class="experience-boundary"><strong>Private by design:</strong> the owner-only Main Database is not silently copied into this public website. Existing ONE import controls remain responsible for loading private packs into the selected browser. The 33-million-book and 66,666-language objectives are plans, not counts of published works.</p>
</section>

<section id="books" class="library-experience" aria-labelledby="books-heading">
 <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">BOOKS · MANUSCRIPTS · EDITIONS · SERIES</p><h2 id="books-heading">Books &amp; Original Series</h2><p>Browse every reading record and series-plan entry currently included in the published Library Mind. Titles, wording, credits and development stages are displayed from the original public records.</p></div>
 <div class="books-toolbar">
   <div class="books-filter" role="group" aria-label="Choose book archive scope"><button type="button" data-book-scope="all" aria-pressed="true">All records</button><button type="button" data-book-scope="reading" aria-pressed="false">Reading records</button><button type="button" data-book-scope="plan" aria-pressed="false">13-book plan</button></div>
   <label for="books-query">Search books, chapters and series</label><input type="search" id="books-query" placeholder="Title, language, source ID, or stage…" autocomplete="off">
 </div>
 <p id="books-status" class="books-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading public book records…</p>
 <div id="books-grid" class="books-grid"></div>
 <button type="button" id="books-more" class="books-more" hidden>Show more records</button>
 <article id="books-reader" class="books-reader" tabindex="-1" hidden aria-labelledby="books-reader-title">
   <div class="reader-title"><div><span class="card-kicker">ORIGINAL RECORD · READ ONLY</span><h3 id="books-reader-title"></h3><p id="books-reader-meta"></p></div><button type="button" id="books-close">Close reader</button></div>
   <pre id="books-reader-body"></pre><a href="../one/library-mind/index.html">Open complete Library Mind ↗</a>
 </article>
 <div class="books-note">Your unreleased books and 2,000+ reported manuscripts are not automatically loaded from ChatGPT, devices or private databases. Open <a href="../one/library/index.html">ONE Master Library</a> to import owner-selected original files. Public reading records include drafts and source references, not just complete published books.</div>
</section>

<section id="book-apps" class="library-experience" aria-labelledby="book-apps-heading">
  <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">BOOK APPS · READ · PLAY · CREATE</p><h2 id="book-apps-heading">Book Apps &amp; Interactive Worlds</h2><p>Direct doors to book-centered applications already present in your ONE ecosystem. These are existing modules—not substitute manuscripts or newly invented series.</p></div>
  <div class="book-app-grid">
    <a class="book-app-card cyan" href="../one/library-mind/index.html"><span>READER + CATALOG</span><h3>THE LIBRARY MIND</h3><p>Books, connected catalog, languages, preserved downloads and manuscript status.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card violet" href="../one/tabor-trinity/index.html"><span>BOOKS + CIPHER + GAME</span><h3>THE TABOR TRINITY</h3><p>THE TABORIC LIGHT · THE LIGHT OF TABOR · THE TABOR LIGHT CIPHER.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card blue" href="../one/assocchio/index.html"><span>BOOK + EDUCATIONAL GAME</span><h3>ASSOCCHIO</h3><p>THE INDOCTRINATION AND PROGRAMMING OF JOHN NATHAN TABOR.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card gold" href="../one/mother-earth/index.html"><span>BOOK + FOLD-OUT APP + GAME</span><h3>MOTHER EARTH</h3><p>THE REPLICATED CREATION CODE · original creative chapter, fold-out and trial module.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card cyan" href="../one/rcc-time/index.html"><span>BOOK + TIME LAB + GAME</span><h3>TIME</h3><p>Read the creative work, explore its formula atlas and interactive time tools.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card violet" href="../one/library-mind/index.html#plan"><span>ORIGINAL SERIES PLAN</span><h3>THE TABOR SECRET SOCIETY</h3><p>All 13 original planned titles, manuscript-stage labels and the active book draft.</p><strong>Open series ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card blue" href="../one/library/index.html"><span>PRIVATE BOOK LIBRARY</span><h3>ONE MASTER LIBRARY</h3><p>Import, search and read your owner-selected original books using the existing local database.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
    <a class="book-app-card gold" href="../dummie-publisher/index.html"><span>PUBLISHING WORKSPACE</span><h3>DUMMIE PUBLISHER</h3><p>Open the existing browser publishing tools; this is not a live commercial bookstore.</p><strong>Open app ↗</strong></a>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="apps"><p class="eyebrow">THE CONNECTED DIRECTORY</p><h2>Every published app doorway.</h2><label for="search">Find an app or project</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Books, games, history, health, ciphers…" autocomplete="off"><p id="results-count" role="status"></p><div id="directory" class="grid"></div><noscript><p><a href="../index.html">Open the full Factory directory</a> or <a href="../one/index.html">open ONE</a>.</p></noscript></section>
<footer><strong>Nathan AI · Main Hub</strong><p>Navigation and archive access are connected here. Existing apps retain their own data and controls. This hub does not run an autonomous writing engine or synchronize accounts.</p><a href="README.md">Nathan AI core and development status</a> · <a href="https://github.com/NathanAIoxr/Nathan-AI-Sovereign-Core">Public source repository</a></footer>
